title: XenServer / XCP-ng: Storage repository I/O
agents: xenserver
catalog: app/citrix
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk

description:
 This check shows throughput, IOPS, latency and queue length of a storage
 repository as measured by the XenServer host (RRD data sources with the SR
 UUID suffix). Data comes from the special agent {agent_xenserver}.
 Optional levels on read/write latency can be configured.

discovery:
 One service per storage repository for which I/O data is available.
